#: includes/Classes/Abilities.php:2323
msgid "Products flagged with the manual per-product \"exclude from feed\" toggle. That flag applies to all feeds, not only this one. Rule/filter-based exclusions are not individually tracked, so per-rule attribution is unavailable."
