#: includes/Classes/Abilities.php:845
msgid "Set feed schedule"
msgstr "Подеси распоред довода"

#: includes/Classes/Abilities.php:846
msgid "Configures a feed refresh schedule: a standard interval (hourly/twicedaily/daily) or a custom interval (every N hours, weekly, monthly, yearly, with optional day-of-week restrictions; requires Product Feed Elite)."
